  "project_description": "This module allows a Drupal duration field on a oEmbed video media entity to be filled by querying the Youtube API.\n\n The duration of a Youtube video cannot be accessed via oEmbed. This is where this module comes in and provides duration by querying the Youtube API. The module relies on a Drupal duration field for storing the duration information and a Youtube/Google API key is needed to query the Youtube API.\n\n Installation \n \n install the module as usual \n Add a duration field to your oEmbed media entity \n Configure your oEmbed media entity to use this duration field to store the duration information (you will also need to put Youtube/Google API key in)",
